[*] --> pending : new submission
pending --> approved : Administrator approves
pending --> rejected : Administrator rejects with reason
pending --> revoked : Administrator revokes with reason
approved --> revoked : Administrator revokes with reason
rejected --> [*]
revoked --> [*]
note right of approved
 No expiry; no deletion or supersede.
 Pending/Approved blocks duplicate submission.
end note
note right of revoked
 Revocation events update trust projections.
 Re-verification creates a NEW record in pending.
end note
